OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos to be removed from former
OL,4,Ahotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said work to safely
OL,7,Fremove materials containing asbestos
OL,8,Ffrom a privately-owned former hotel
OL,9,Fwill begin on Monday.
OL,11,FTorbay Council said the works were part
OL,12,Fof ongoing management of the buildings
OL,13,Fat 62-70 Victoria Street in Paignton,
OL,14,FDevon.
OL,16,FIn July the council said it had
OL,17,Fappointed contractors to fully demolish
OL,18,Fthe buildings.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
