OL,3,GNEWSAAsbestos to be removed from former
OL,4,Ahotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said ahead of the removal works the
OL,7,Fstructure would be enclosed to create a
OL,8,F"sealed and airtight" working
OL,9,Fenvironment and specialist licensed
OL,10,Fcontractors will then remove asbestos
OL,11,Finsulating board from parts of the
OL,12,Fground floor. It is expected to take
OL,13,Fapproximately four weeks.
